==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paradox Rift|Flittle|80}} from the {{TCG|Paradox Rift}} expansion.
**The entrance hall of [[Uva Academy]], as depicted in {{g|Violet}}, is featured in the illustration.
*'''Flop''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Magikarp|47}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

